message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
title: "FerriteSolidMechanics.jl"
abstract: >-
  A solid mechanics assembly framework and material model library for Ferrite.jl.
  A generic material assembler handles DOFs, sparse assembly, threading, MPI reduction and trial/commit state updating, so a constitutive model is written only at the quadrature point (UMAT-like) level.
  The bundled models range from linear elasticity to finite-strain hyperelastic and viscoelastic-viscoplastic laws.
